### [Sign Out](#sign-out)

To sign a user out, you can use the `signOut` function provided by the client.

ClientServer

[](#api-method-sign-out)

POST/sign-out

```
await authClient.signOut();
```

POST/sign-out

```
await auth.api.signOut({    // This endpoint requires session cookies.    headers: await headers(),});
